{"steam_appid":2085540,"steam_name":"Stick It to the Stickman","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2085540/1888141250/0f549d228e3c2c586aac3ea4fea3cd35a966a568/1777920904/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1777921223","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257331436/4d5385903d58d4a073df108e5ac49c22e0e184b8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1777921223","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/5175d8ce0cea8d6c67893c97e247b65c01a188a9/ss_5175d8ce0cea8d6c67893c97e247b65c01a188a9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777921224","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/932b141ad6728d1487bc77e6a4b9bc115ded9e6f/ss_932b141ad6728d1487bc77e6a4b9bc115ded9e6f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777921224","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/b51b6ebc69bbeddff2daba938e08fb41fb377fb6/ss_b51b6ebc69bbeddff2daba938e08fb41fb377fb6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777921224","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/aa9dbeee24dc62cd677f677fc9647fc12be43452/ss_aa9dbeee24dc62cd677f677fc9647fc12be43452.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777921224","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/d96f721faeffda33e0453eefbc4201f15b36668d/ss_d96f721faeffda33e0453eefbc4201f15b36668d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777921224"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/bf25c378bc572d6de3ee928c651ac517.poster.avif?t=1777921224\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/bf25c378bc572d6de3ee928c651ac517.webm?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/bf25c378bc572d6de3ee928c651ac517.mp4?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Punch, kick, slice, dice, burn, blast, staple-gun, fireball, jackhammer, and chainsaw your way up the corporate ladder solo or with a 'friend' in a truly hostile work environment. And remember: every red stickman you defeat is one dead red stickman closer to a promotion!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/44ba995dca03a267882ac40095728235.poster.avif?t=1777921224\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/44ba995dca03a267882ac40095728235.webm?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/44ba995dca03a267882ac40095728235.mp4?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT DO WE DO HERE?</h2>Here at this great company, we do the thing. To be clear: the thing is what we do. But can YOU do the thing? Do you know the deadly art of the handshake? Can you perform an exploding heart punch? Successful applicants will be issued a range of brutal weaponry to help them become the boss. But watch out: everyone else wants the job too.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/db82299696197d6942b7575c389d9e75.poster.avif?t=1777921224\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/db82299696197d6942b7575c389d9e75.webm?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/db82299696197d6942b7575c389d9e75.mp4?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ONLY WAY UPWARDS IS SIDEWAYS</h2>Stickmen need jobs, but more importantly, shareholders need growth. Climb to the top of the tower to crush your boss's nuts, and please note that 50% of office work is kicking stickmen out of windows. Deliver parcels and dash from task to task, with lots of murder in between.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/7fcfd5bc571e6ae829c0851e447a5c1b.poster.avif?t=1777921224\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/7fcfd5bc571e6ae829c0851e447a5c1b.webm?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/7fcfd5bc571e6ae829c0851e447a5c1b.mp4?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME THE BOSS</h2>Fight other CEOs for the prestige of being the CEO with the biggest muscles. Perform dubiously legal tasks critical to expanding the company. Steal cars, suppress protestors, and kidnap building inspectors, all in the name of profit. Because without profit, there is nothing. NOTHING!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/e14ad279dd5bc5fff37d536fcf048a6c.poster.avif?t=1777921224\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/e14ad279dd5bc5fff37d536fcf048a6c.webm?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/e14ad279dd5bc5fff37d536fcf048a6c.mp4?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHAKE HANDS WITH THE FREE MARKET</h2>Build out your own company with our Level Builder. Take control of hiring, firing, furnishing, marketing, and catering decisions as you upload your creations to the Steam Workshop. Then, download and evaluate the ideas of the other entrepreneurs within the community for your own enjoyment!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/7a3090b098a1b3feca8a8ab495c7cb22.poster.avif?t=1777921224\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/7a3090b098a1b3feca8a8ab495c7cb22.webm?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/7a3090b098a1b3feca8a8ab495c7cb22.mp4?t=1777921224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / Radeon RX 570 / Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low Quality setting, in 1080p, producing 30 FPS</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-11800 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce RTX 2080 / Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> High Quality setting, in 1080p, producing 60 FPS</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Early Access"],"developers":["Free Lives"],"publishers":["Devolver Digital"],"